# Pairs with GateOwnership. Two splits of one leaf under a single gate is exactly what the gate exists to prevent.
MODULE: ForegroundIgnoresBusyGate
TARGET: GateOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: SplitAsync takes B's split gate while another turn holds it
PERTURBS: ForegroundTakeGate

--- FIND
    /\ fg = "gate"
    /\ gate["B"] = "free"
--- REPLACE
    /\ fg = "gate"
    \* MUTATION: the gate is not awaited
--- END
